        {
          "text": "Bada ya higo, nátsupha matso nahenda hivi, nchiona mryango u laza mlunguni! Alafu nchisikira iratu sauti dza ya gunda yonigombekeza kpwandza ichiamba, “Ndzo hiku dzulu, ili nikuonyese mambo ambago ni lazima gahendeke badaye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.1"
            ]
